{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-33","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number have its half odd, it is even-times odd only.","book":9,"number":33,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.33","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.33/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":33,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-33@raw-26f66d759345f9ef","contentId":"euclid-9-33","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26f66d759345f9ef1326a76dc237b2ead62f23ac68cfe68611042b9310cb3725","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-33.statement","euclid-9-33.construction.1","euclid-9-33.proof.1","euclid-9-33.proof.2","euclid-9-33.proof.3","euclid-9-33.conclusion","euclid-9-33.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-33.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-33","revisionId":"euclid-9-33@raw-26f66d759345f9ef","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b80e7203ffb37828e830a8f97e6dc5ca9f69db22927ca420f92de8f0d1e8d4f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number have its half odd, it is even-times odd only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果数字有一半的奇数, 则偶数就很奇怪。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-33.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-33","revisionId":"euclid-9-33@raw-26f66d759345f9ef","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"328a2fe89babbde1f3710876f26c9e70d6dc62e9d54376c0c159429ef4bb661a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number A have its half odd; I say that A is even-times odd only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A数字有一半奇怪;我说A数字是偶数奇数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-33.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-33","revisionId":"euclid-9-33@raw-26f66d759345f9ef","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f1311d02991a4909ae800940783694f91ecc2b4f1307f36aaef09bc27f21bc2","citations":["euclid-7-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now that it is even-times odd is manifest; for the half of it, being odd, measures it an even number of times. [[VII. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-7-def-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,偶数奇数是明显的;其中一半奇数是整除倍。 [[VII. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-7-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-33.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-33","revisionId":"euclid-9-33@raw-26f66d759345f9ef","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e74ac885bea517df4c2a25a627a1f6842ebeedfa6ff0857aeef716531993c1a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also even-times odd only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它也是偶数奇特的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-33.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-33","revisionId":"euclid-9-33@raw-26f66d759345f9ef","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f8dc3d63ebdcd0307e0d5095ef610d11b900b04e6eebadd066f73d13672d518e","citations":["euclid-7-def-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if A is even-times even also, it will be measured by an even number according to an even number; [[VII. Def. 8](/principles/euclid-7-def-8)] so that the half of it will also be measured by an even number though it is odd: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果A也是偶数,那么,它就会按照偶数以偶数整除;那么,它的一半也将以偶数整除,尽管这是奇怪的:这是荒谬的。 [[VII. Def. 8](/principles/euclid-7-def-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-33.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-33","revisionId":"euclid-9-33@raw-26f66d759345f9ef","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa7d24711bd0f1b813720a12226ada261742a98b77f2d8ba56eed8034808237f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A is even-times odd only. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A偶数奇数。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-33.source","contentId":"euclid-9-33","revisionId":"euclid-9-33@raw-26f66d759345f9ef","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"937578da7eeb3c59e4f5c76e18d708d729bfc9482e5951c5897fd66c2bbbaac6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.33/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.33\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-33:euclid-7-def-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-33.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https:/